## Error Handling

- **Bronze Write Errors**: Storage failures, permission issues
- **Silver DQ Failures**: Data quality rule violations
- **Gold Validation Failures**: Strict validation failures
- **Quarantine Handling**: Failed data routing to quarantine

## Metrics Emitted

- `chembl_bronze_write_start` — Bronze write initiated
- `chembl_bronze_write_complete` — Bronze write completed
- `chembl_bronze_write_failed` — Bronze write failed
- `chembl_silver_write_start` — Silver write initiated
- `chembl_silver_write_complete` — Silver write completed
- `chembl_silver_write_failed` — Silver write failed
- `chembl_silver_quarantined` — Data routed to Silver quarantine
- `chembl_gold_write_start` — Gold write initiated
- `chembl_gold_write_complete` — Gold write completed
- `chembl_gold_write_failed` — Gold write failed
- `chembl_gold_quarantined` — Data routed to Gold quarantine
